+    // [netview] Online, each machine shows only its OWN fighter full screen. BT3-Recomp's netplay makes both
+    // players' views full screen in the guest (so the simulation is identical on both sides) and marks them in
+    // the scissor's top row: player 1's view has y0 = 1, player 2's y0 = 2 (game_overrides.cpp, bt3NetViewSelect);
